OL,3,GNEWSAFans and stars gather for Jimmy
OL,4,ACricket's funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamily, friends, fellow performers and
OL,7,Ffans of veteran comic Jimmy Cricket
OL,8,Fhave gathered for his funeral.
OL,10,FThe Northern Ireland-born comedian,
OL,11,Freal name James Joseph Mulgrew, died on
OL,12,F3 August aged 80.
OL,14,FMany mourners at Salford Cathedral
OL,15,Fresponded to his family's request to
OL,16,Fwear bow ties in a nod to one of his
OL,17,Fprops, while his trademark stage
OL,18,Fwellies and bowler hat were placed at
OL,19,Fthe cathedral entrance next to a book
OL,20,Fof condolence.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
