OL,3,GNEWSAFans and stars gather for Jimmy
OL,4,ACricket's funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe requiem Mass was led by his son Fr
OL,7,FFrankiel Mulgrew, who is based at the
OL,8,Fcathedral.
